        }
      ],
      "presentation": "breakdown-strip",
      "phrases": []
    },
    {
      "id": "standard-way",
      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Giảm giá chút được không? is the cleaner discount question here. It keeps the ask light, includes chút for 'a little,' and gives the seller room to say yes, no, or counteroffer without losing face.",
      "phrases": [
        {
          "id": "v500-shop-can-you-lower-the-price",
          "vietnamese": "Giảm giá chút được không?",
          "english": "Can you lower the price?",
          "pronunciation": "zam zah choot dook khong",
          "symbolName": "speaker.wave.2.fill",
          "tintName": "purple",
          "detailPageID": null,
          "audioKey": "audio-authored-giam-gia-chut-duoc-khong-a718a9e74f"
        }
      ],
      "presentation": "phrase-list",
      "breakdown": []
    },
    {
      "id": "why-it-matters",
      "title": "Why it matters",
      "body": "Price talk is partly social in markets. A small, friendly ask sounds better than a hard demand because it lets the seller protect the mood while still changing the number.",
      "presentation": "plain-text",
      "phrases": [],
      "breakdown": []
    },
    {
      "id": "traveler-insight",
      "title": "Traveler insight",
      "body": "The reply may be a number, typed amount, calculator screen, or direct yes/no about payment. Say Giảm giá chút được không?",
      "phrases": [
        {
          "id": "shop-1",
          "vietnamese": "Tôi muốn cỡ này",
          "english": "I want this size",
          "pronunciation": "toy moo-on guh nai",
          "symbolName": "speaker.wave.2.fill",
          "tintName": "purple",
          "detailPageID": "viet-family-shopping-size",
          "audioKey": "shop-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "shop-2",
          "vietnamese": "Có màu khác không?",
          "english": "Do you have another color?",
          "pronunciation": "koh mau khak khong",
          "symbolName": "speaker.wave.2.fill",
          "tintName": "purple",
          "detailPageID": "viet-family-shopping-color",
          "audioKey": "shop-2"
        },
        {
          "id": "shop-3",
          "vietnamese": "Tôi thử cái này được không?",
          "english": "Can I try this on?",
          "pronunciation": "toy thoo gai nai dook khong",
          "symbolName": "speaker.wave.2.fill",
          "tintName": "purple",
          "detailPageID": "viet-family-shopping-try-on",
          "audioKey": "shop-3"
        }
      ],
      "presentation": "phrase-list",
      "breakdown": []
    },
    {
      "id": "when-to-use",
      "title": "When to use it",
      "body": "Use it after you know the price and still want to buy if the seller can lower it a little. It works best when you are holding or pointing at one item, not while asking about a whole shelf.",
      "phrases": [
        {
          "id": "shop-4",
          "vietnamese": "Tôi chỉ xem thôi",
          "english": "I’m just looking",
          "pronunciation": "toy chee sem toy",
          "symbolName": "speaker.wave.2.fill",
          "tintName": "purple",
          "detailPageID": "viet-family-shopping-just-looking",
          "audioKey": "shop-4"
        },
        {
          "id": "shop-5",
          "vietnamese": "Trả ở đâu?",
          "english": "Where do I pay?",
          "pronunciation": "tra uh dow",
          "symbolName": "speaker.wave.2.fill",
          "tintName": "purple",
          "detailPageID": "viet-family-shopping-pay-where",
          "audioKey": "shop-5"
        },
        {
          "id": "v500-shop-how-much-is-this-item",
          "vietnamese": "Mặt hàng này giá bao nhiêu?",
          "english": "How much is this item?",
          "pronunciation": "Mat hang nay gia bao nhieu",
          "symbolName": "speaker.wave.2.fill",
          "tintName": "purple",
          "detailPageID": "viet-family-v500-shop-how-much-is-this-item",
          "audioKey": "v500-shop-how-much-is-this-item"
        }
      ],
      "presentation": "phrase-list",
      "breakdown": []
    },
    {
      "id": "good-to-know",
      "title": "Good to know",
      "body": "Keep your tone friendly. In Vietnam, bargaining can be playful in markets but awkward in fixed-price stores.",
      "presentation": "tip-callout",
      "phrases": [],
      "breakdown": []
    },
    {
